    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aae7d1f7cab5fb42",
      "translationZh": "今天发现了一个非常酷的项目：Victor 开发的 Pi，使用 WebGPU 完全在浏览器中运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ddc7273f644f0ca6",
      "translationZh": "有意思的是，它完全不涉及云端模型。它使用 MiniCPM5-2B + Transformers.js + WebGPU + 4 位 ONNX 权重，在本地运行编程智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "766c48baa05137fd",
      "translationZh": "我想看看一个 2B 模型是否真的能处理智能体式编程任务，于是给了它一个小型代码仓库，其中有一个被故意弄坏的函数，并要求它：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6c90db7d34f1af81",
      "translationZh": "跨文件追踪这个 bug",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1f58f9f7162e510e",
      "translationZh": "找出根本原因",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "43bf66b18ce827a0",
      "translationZh": "总结它做了哪些修改",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc98085d3a60b187",
      "translationZh": "结果它真的找到了这个 bug，修改了正确的那一行，还添加了一个相关的测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50619b0d819abc51",
      "translationZh": "我遇到的一个限制是，这个演示不包含 Node.js 或 npm，因此它无法运行 JavaScript 测试套件。这次修复仅通过代码审查进行了检查。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5400431d514c4264",
      "translationZh": "看到一个 2B 模型完全在浏览器本地充当编程智能体，还是挺让人震撼的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1aa87733a146a46e",
      "translationZh": "这让我好奇，如果有更好的 WebGPU 配置 + 更长的上下文 + 更复杂的代码仓库，能把它的能力推到什么程度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ad11c6e6ae2e884",
      "translationZh": "项目：https://huggingface.co/spaces/victor/MiniCPM5-2B-WebGPU-Pi",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
